    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC4PnQnQgM",
      "content": "On a bedroom. O-N-A-B-A-T-O.",
      "name": "Teju Onabajo",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:16:40.987548",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay. Gotcha. Let's see here. Okay, yeah, so I see we currently have you set for Saturday September 12th with the starting window between 8:30 AM to 9:00 AM, we are expecting this move to take, it looks like around eight and a half hours to complete. So we admittedly, we wouldn't really be able to push that starting time any later just knowing that, of course, we're gonna want to ensure that our crew we can get them home in a decent time. So what we really could do.",
