    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC4PnQnQgM",
      "content": "Mm-hmm.",
      "name": "Teju Onabajo",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:16:57.787548",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC4PnQnQgM",
      "content": "I don't think it's gonna take, yeah, I don't think it's gonna take eight hours by the way, because I think it's, like, I'm not sure why she said that, because I told her that I was gonna do most of the packing of my clothes. It was mainly gonna be like the kitchen, which is, it's a one Bridger department. So it is pots and pans and then the furniture. So, I don't see it taking eight hours at all.",
      "name": "Teju Onabajo",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:17:16.387548",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, well then, yeah, what we can do is we can certainly book the move for, you know, later in the day. But then of course, what we're going to have to do is, is reduce the amount of time that will be available to work for you down beneath that eight and a half hours. Of course now knowing that.",
      "name": "Garrison Cobe",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:17:42.605947",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6636690200690688"
    },
    {
      "content": "ai_scorecard_llm_v2",
      "name": "Garrison Cobe",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:17:42.605947",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "6636690200690688"
    },
    {
      "content": "You know, you'll be, I mean, of course, that said the kitchen is still gonna be kind of the most time consuming part of the packing process. We can see even in a one bedroom apartment depending of course on the contents of it can take even one to two hours to pack up a kitchen depending. But that said, yeah, what time were we kind of looking to get started at here, so that kind of everything will line up appropriately.",
      "name": "Garrison Cobe",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:18:03.605947",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6636690200690688"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDC4PnQnQgM",
      "content": "Yeah, I'm thinking maybe one because of the avail the elevator is the elevators become available at three then it gives us like a two hour head start basically.",
      "name": "Teju Onabajo",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:18:31.387548",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, gotcha. And this is for, just to, to confirm, this is for the Victory Avenue. The apartment and things. Okay. You get that elevator at three? I see, okay. Yeah, then, then I think we could probably do that. That makes sense. Let's see here. Now. Let me go ahead and make a quick adjustment.",
      "name": "Garrison Cobe",
      "time": "2026-09-01T20:18:45.605947",
