      "time": "2026-09-01T20:18:51.187548",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, so what we do have also just to let you know because we would be looking at now an afternoon start time. We would then have a morning move prior to yours. So, when we do have those afternoon start times, we technically have a two hour arrival window. So what we could set it up as-is maybe an arrival window between 12:00 AM to 2:00 PM, you know. So, hopefully we arrive somewhere right around the middle slash earlier part of that but do you think that might potentially work out okay with that schedule?",
